          <header>
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">DeepSeek V4 API 2026: <span class="text-blue-600">OpenRouter Token King</span></h1>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
              <time datetime="2026-07-07">July 7, 2026</time>
